WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:09.570
Follow the vegetation edge at Vänern. The showcase examines the boundary between vegetation, exposed ground and water.

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:17.250
Vegetation indices separate water, bare surfaces and vegetation before edge extraction.

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:25.890
Annual edge estimates reveal where the mapped boundary changes between 2018 and 2025.

00:00:27.010 --> 00:00:34.690
Spectral-change maps add context. The images alone do not establish why a boundary moved.
